WEBVTT

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.200
-Can!
-REX: Whoa!

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.480
-Oh, wow, you flew magnificently!
-(WHISTLING)

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.200
I found my movin' buddy.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.680
Thank you. Th-Thank you all.
Thank you.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.640
That wasn't flying!
That was... falling with style.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.880
Man, the dolls must really
go for you. Can you teach me that?

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.880
-(LAUGHING) Golly bob howdy!
-Oh, shut up!

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:28.960
You know, in a couple of days,

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.360
everything will be just the way
it was. They'll see.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.160
-(ALL CHATTERING)
-WOODY: They'll see.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.600
I'm still Andy's favorite toy.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.840
♪ I was on top of the world
livin' high

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.640
♪ It was right in my pocket

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.800
ANDY: (LAUGHING) Whoa!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.000
♪ I was livin' the life

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.480
♪ Things were just the way
they should be

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.080
♪ When from out of the sky
like a bomb

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.400
♪ Comes some little punk
in a rocket

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.600
(LASER BUZZING)

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.080
♪ Now all of a sudden some
strange things are happening to me

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.120
Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:08.520
♪ Strange

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:11.040
♪ Things are happening to me

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:16.480
♪ Strange

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:19.840
♪ Things

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:24.840
♪ Strange things
are happening to me

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:25.920
(LOUD ROAR)

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.040
♪ Ain't no doubt about it

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:37.200
♪ I had friends
I had lots of friends

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.760
♪ Now all my friends are gone

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.040
♪ And I'm doin' the best I can

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.960
♪ To carry on

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:49.440
-♪ I had power
-CHORUS: ♪ Power

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.920
-♪ I was respected
-♪ Respected

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:55.000
♪ But not any more

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.800
♪ And I've lost the love of the one

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.680
♪ Whom I adore

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:05.080
♪ Let me tell you 'bout it
Strange

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.960
♪ Things are happenin' to me

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:09.480
(SLINKY GRUNTS)

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:13.120
♪ Strange

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.240
♪ Things

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.360
♪ Strange

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:22.160
♪ Things are happenin' to me

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.640
♪ Ain't no doubt about it

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:31.000
♪ Strange

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.480
♪ Things

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:37.840
♪ Strange ♪ Strange

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.960
♪ Things ♪

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:41.440
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.640
(GRUNTS) Finally!

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.720
(SIGHS) Hey, who's got my hat?

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.600
(SQUEAKS) Look, I'm Woody!
Howdy, howdy, howdy!

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:52.800
Ah-ha! Ah-ha, ha, ha!
Gimme that!

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.560
Say there, Lizard and Stretchy Dog,
let me show you something.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:58.560
It looks as though I've been
accepted into your culture.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.520
Your chief, Andy,
inscribed his name on me.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.680
TOGETHER: Wow!

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.680
With permanent ink too!

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:07.440
Well, I must get back
to repairing my ship.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.200
Don't let it get to you, Woody.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.600
Uh... let what? I don't, uh...
What do you mean? Who?

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:18.800
I know Andy's
excited about Buzz.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:22.240
But you know he'll always have
a special place for you.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:26.200
-Yeah, like the attic. (CHUCKLING)
-All right, that's it!

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:29.200
-(TONAL HUMMING SOUND)
-Hmm. Unidirectional bonding strip.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.880
Mr. Lightyear wants more tape.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:34.040
(HUMMING) Hmm?

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.560
Listen, Light Snack,
you stay away from Andy.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:41.400
He's mine, and no one
is taking him away from me.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:42.960
What are you talking about?

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.600
-Where's that bonding strip?
-(BEEPING SOUND)

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.240
And another thing,

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:52.440
stop with this spaceman thing!
It's getting on my nerves!

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.920
Are you saying you wanna lodge
a complaint with Star Command?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.960
Oh-ho, okay! Ooh, well, so you wanna
do it the hard way, huh?

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:02.880
-Don't even think about it, cowboy.
-Oh, yeah, tough guy?

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.360
-(MECHANICAL WHOOSH)
-(GASPS)

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:08.080
(CHOKING)

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.640
(CHOKING CONTINUES)

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:16.400
(PANTING, SNIFFING)
The air isn't... toxic.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:20.080
How dare you open a spaceman's
helmet on an uncharted planet!

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.480
My eyeballs could've been
sucked from their sockets!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:28.600
You actually think
you're the Buzz Lightyear?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.720
(LAUGHING) Oh, all this time
I thought it was an act!

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:35.560
Hey, guys, look!
It's the real Buzz Lightyear!

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:36.960
You're mocking me,
aren't you?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.800
Oh, no, no. No, no, no, no, no.
Buzz, look, an alien!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.240
-Where?
-(LAUGHING)

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.800
-(LAUGHING CONTINUES)
-(DOG BARKING)

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.000
-(BARKING CONTINUES)
-BOY: (LAUGHING) Yes!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.880
-Whoa!
-Uh-oh.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.000
It's Sid!

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:56.800
-(TEETH CHATTERING)
-SID: Don't Move!

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:58.560
I thought he was at summer camp.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.760
They must've kicked him out
early this year.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.120
-(ROBOT BUZZING)
-REX: Oh, no, not Sid!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.640
-SID: (GRUNTING) Incoming!
-(DOG BARKING)

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.960
-Who is it this time?
-I... I can't... I can't tell.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.160
-Hey, where's Lenny?
-Right here, Woody.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:16.120
Oh, no, I can't bear to watch
one of these again.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:19.320
WOODY: Oh, no,
it's a Combat Carl.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.400
What's going on?

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:24.160
Nothing that concerns you spacemen,
just us toys.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:25.760
I'd better take a look anyway.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:26.840
(SID SHOUTING)

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.320
BUZZ: Why is that soldier
strapped to an explosive device?

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:31.680
That's why, Sid.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:34.120
-(BARKING)
-Hmm, sure is a hairy fellow.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.240
No, no, that's Scud, you idiot.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.760
-That is Sid.
-(SINISTER LAUGHTER)

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.800
-You mean that happy child?
-That ain't no happy child.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:46.120
He tortures toys, just for fun!

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:49.200
-(BARKING)
-(GRUNTING)

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:51.760
Well, then we've got
to do something.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.680
What are you doing?
Get down from there!

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:57.040
-I'm gonna teach that boy a lesson.
-Yeah, sure. You go ahead.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.400
-Melt him with your scary laser.
-(BUZZING)

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:02.480
Be careful with that!
It's extremely dangerous.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.320
He's lighting it!
He's lighting it! Hit the dirt!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:06.400
(BO SCREAMS)

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:08.200
-Look out!
-(EXPLOSION)

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:15.000
-(SCUD BARKING)
-Yes! He's gone! He's history!

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:18.120
-(LAUGHING) Whoo!
-I could've stopped him.

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.400
Buzz, I would love
to see you try.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.000
Of course, I'd love
to see you as a crater.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:27.520
-The sooner we move, the better.
-(SID SHOUTING)

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.560
Yeah!
(LAUGHING)

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:31.560
(CRICKETS CHIRPING)

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.600
ANDY: To infinity and beyond!

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:39.400
(IMITATES ROCKET SOUNDS
AND EXPLOSIONS)

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:40.960
All this packing
makes me hungry.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.960
What would you say to dinner
at, oh, Pizza Planet?

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.960
Pizza Planet? Oh, cool!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.760
MOM: (LAUGHS) Go wash your hands,
and I'll get Molly ready.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.120
-ANDY: Can I bring some toys?
-You can bring one toy.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.160
-Just one?
-One toy?

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.920
-(SIGHS)
-Hmm.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:04.680
-Will Andy pick me?
-(LIQUID SWISHING)

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.240
"Don't count on it"? (GROANS)

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.160
(YELLS)

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.120
(THUD)

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.200
(BUZZ HUMMING)

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.920
(HUMMING CONTINUES)

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.160
Mmm!

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:33.000
Buzz! Oh, Buzz!
Buzz Lightyear.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:35.440
(PANTING) Buzz Lightyear,
thank goodness. We've got trouble!

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:38.160
-Trouble? Where?
-Down there. Just down there.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:41.000
A helpless toy, it's...
it's trapped, Buzz!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:43.520
Then we've no time to lose.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.480
I don't see anything!

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.800
Oh, he's there!
Just, just keep looking!

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:55.080
-What kind of toy... (GASPS)
-(GASPS)

